        "content": "import { Meta, Primary, Controls } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\r\nimport * as DemoStories from './demo.stories';\r\n\r\n<Meta of={DemoStories} />\r\n\r\n# Split Flap Text\r\n\r\nSplit Flap Text displays short messages as animated split-flap character tiles. It is designed for prominent status, readiness, or announcement text in a page or case view.\r\n\r\n<Primary />\r\n\r\n## Props\r\n\r\n<Controls />\r\n\r\n## Configuration\r\n\r\nAdd the **Split Flap Text** widget to a page or case view and set only the `text` property, for example:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nLAUNCH READY\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe widget performs one split-flap animation when the text is rendered. Keep the text short enough to fit the available layout width.\r\n\r\nThe tile count automatically matches the text. For example, `HELLO` renders five tiles and `WELCOME` renders seven."
